%% class: center

# A deck in chapters

One file per chapter, ordered by file name.

%% notes

`demo/decks/` holds three files. The build joins them in name order, so the running order is visible in a directory listing.

---

{{ ../partials/house-rules.crv }}

---

## Why chapters

- A commit touches one chapter, so the diff is readable
- Reordering is renaming
- A shared slide lives in one file and is included where it is needed
